ng
the `p384` crate v0.13.0. The issue results in a stack overflow and SIGSEGV=
 during compilation:

error: rustc interrupted by SIGSEGV, printing backtrace

TOPDIR/tmp-glibc/work/cortexa15t2hf-neon-wrs-linux-gnueabi/cargo/1.85.1-r0/=
